{
  "variant": "cta-band",
  "group": "cta",
  "summary": "Short call-to-action panel in the brand's dark color with soft glows: title, one line, one or two buttons, optional ticks and a photo on the right. Use mid-page to break up long pages, or as the closing CTA when the client has no quote form.",
